# Official remote Bolesa Sandbox / approved remote Partner credentials only.
# Never put local 127.0.0.1 credentials here. Never reuse .env.sandbox.
#
# Known Egypt staging Partner API host (docs / live OpenAPI):
#   https://dev-egy.bolesa.net/api/pcl/v1
# Staging hostname alone is NOT sufficient — /me must return test_mode=true
# for the token you place here before any AWB create/cancel.
#
# Copy to gitignored `.env.remote-sandbox` and fill:

BOLESA_ENV_IDENTITY=official-remote-sandbox
BOLESA_API_BASE_URL=https://dev-egy.bolesa.net/api/pcl/v1
BOLESA_PARTNER_TOKEN=xp_REPLACE_REMOTE_SANDBOX_TOKEN
BOLESA_REMOTE_SANDBOX_ALLOWED_HOSTS=dev-egy.bolesa.net
# Optional: assert /me account identity
# BOLESA_EXPECTED_ACCOUNT_ID=
